      "source_id": "10",
      "stem": "An object can escape a spherical moon of mass \\(M\\) and radius \\(R\\) if it reaches escape speed \\(v_{\\text{esc}}=\\sqrt{\\dfrac{2GM}{R}}\\). Based on this expression, which statement is correct?",
      "options": [
