    {
      "source_id": "13",
      "stem": "A \\(65\\,\\mathrm{kg}\\) student standing at rest on a low-friction skateboard catches a \\(0.50\\,\\mathrm{kg}\\) ball thrown horizontally at \\(20\\,\\mathrm{m/s}\\). What is the student's speed immediately after catching the ball?",
